      "raw": "<div data-bbox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" data-label=\"Image\"><img alt=\"A blank page from a 1942 German telephone directory, showing a grid of empty boxes for town listings.\"/>This image shows a blank page from a 1942 German telephone directory (Reichstelefonbuch). The page is organized into a grid of empty boxes, each intended for a town or region. The grid is divided into three main horizontal sections. The top section contains a single row of boxes. The middle section contains two rows of boxes. The bottom section contains two rows of boxes. The boxes are arranged in a regular grid pattern, with some boxes appearing to be grouped together. The overall layout is clean and minimalist, typical of a directory page from that era.</div>",
